#
# Keyed on <file><TAB><name>, not file:line — line numbers churn on every
# unrelated edit, and a noisy ratchet gets regenerated reflexively, which is
# how a ratchet stops ratcheting.
#
# REGENERATING THIS FILE IS NOT A FIX.
#   + MORE rows — a suite acquired an unfollowable `source`, and every name
#     behind it is now unjudged. First ask whether the `source` is real code or
