#     fixture (or leave it — the lint now strips heredocs before the source
#     scan, so it should not reach here at all), not to record the row.
#   - FEWER rows — the resolver widened, or a suite was cleaned up. Good.
#     Regenerate and say which, in the commit message.
#
# EMPTY IS A REAL STATE AND IT WAS THE CURRENT ONE until the population widened.
